error[V2211]: `abortOn` names `p95`, which has no threshold
  --> load/users/browse.load.yaml:13:27
   |
13 | abortOn: [errorRate, p99, p95]
   |                           ^^^ never breached
   = note: a run stops early only when a threshold on the metric is breached
   = help: add a threshold such as `thresholds: {p95: {lt: …}}`, or remove `p95` from `abortOn`

error[V2211]: `parallel` on an action that does not loop
 --> services/users/crud.test.yaml:5:9
  |
5 |         parallel: 5
  |         ^^^^^^^^ needs `repeat` or `forEach`
  = help: `parallel` sets how many iterations run at a time: add `repeat: 10` or `forEach`, or remove `parallel`
